Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.10,0:02:11.80,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn back!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.80,0:02:14.04,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.04,0:02:15.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.54,0:02:18.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were about to\Ncatch up with Sanji, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.21,0:02:20.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, apologize!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.31,0:02:23.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.55,0:02:25.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dumb frog!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.40,0:02:30.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna eat you!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.35,0:02:36.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno what's going on out there\Nright now, but it can't be good!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.94,0:02:38.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you guys all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.73,0:02:44.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.31,0:02:45.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.21,0:02:46.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My back!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.78,0:02:50.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.45,0:02:53.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our King Bulls are gone!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.00,0:02:55.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They disappeared!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.42,0:02:57.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– No way!\N– No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.16,0:02:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But how?!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.42,0:03:00.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, we're the ones who disappeared.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.79,0:03:03.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our train probably got\Nderailed back there.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.26,0:03:06.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Whoa, that's even worse!\N– Whoa, that's even worse!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.06,0:03:06.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What now?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.75,0:03:07.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.98,0:03:08.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.68,0:03:10.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are we gonna be okay, or what?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.52,0:03:15.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we can't make it to Enies Lobby,\NI'm gonna be really pissed off!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.62,0:03:17.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut yer trap and gimme a sec!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.65,0:03:19.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to work!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.78,0:03:21.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh, that's weird.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.07,0:03:24.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think there's somethin' funny\Ngoing on with this current.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.11,0:03:26.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems like we're stuck.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.10,0:03:27.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokoro?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.64,0:03:29.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you know which direction to go?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.51,0:03:30.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Of course I do!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.78,0:03:34.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When we built the Sea Trains we\Nequipped 'em with Eternal Poses
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.60,0:03:37.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,set to all the islands\Nwith stations on 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.00,0:03:38.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then we'll be fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.80,0:03:41.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll watch the sea-you just steer.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.07,0:03:43.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? You sure that'll help?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.00,0:03:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a navigator. I got this!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.40,0:03:48.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see! Huh!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.27,0:03:50.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's good to know!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.21,0:03:54.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, almost forgot.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.21,0:03:56.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey Yokozuna, stop wrasslin'
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.41,0:03:59.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and get your froggy butt over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.44,0:04:06.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.39,0:04:09.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He ran away!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.83,0:04:13.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero, gero, gero!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.30,0:04:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.00,0:04:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're glad I'm still okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.74,0:04:17.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How sweet!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.11,0:04:20.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know you were just trying\Nto save me, but you jumped the gun.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.81,0:04:22.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These folks didn't kidnap me.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.81,0:04:23.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.51,0:04:27.72,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Does this mean that\NGranny can speak frog?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.49,0:04:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you guys looking at?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.46,0:04:37.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That ugly old lady is\Ntalking to a giant frog.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.93,0:04:38.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! I get it!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.90,0:04:40.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Granny was a frog all along!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.66,0:04:43.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She never quite passed\Nas a human, now did she?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.50,0:04:46.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You realize you guys are gonna\Nget hit for that later, don't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.54,0:04:47.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.87,0:04:49.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello?! Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.81,0:04:51.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rocketman?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.38,0:04:52.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you see them yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.64,0:04:53.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.51,0:04:54.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.69,0:04:56.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn that stupid frog!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.96,0:05:00.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That thing musta sent them\Nflying a million miles away!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.30,0:05:01.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.00,0:05:02.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't start losing hope on me!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.50,0:05:06.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We set out to save our bro Franky and\Nwe won't stop till we make it happen!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.91,0:05:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.04,0:05:11.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}All we can do now is keep on heading\Nto Enies Lobby and have faith that Rocketman
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.58,0:05:13.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is gonna meet us whenever we get there!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.71,0:05:19.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go! Sodom! Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.04,0:05:22.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hold on.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.81,0:05:24.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that over there?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.69,0:05:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like there's another train\Ncar floating just ahead of us!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.00,0:05:29.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It could be full of enemies!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.90,0:05:30.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.87,0:05:32.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's prepare for battle!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.35,0:05:34.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.12,0:05:36.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahoy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.95,0:05:38.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is anyone in there?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.92,0:05:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're the Franky Family!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.89,0:05:42.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come out and show yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.94,0:05:45.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, I see someone!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.51,0:05:51.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.57,0:05:53.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's really alive?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.58,0:05:55.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not just yankin' my chain?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.94,0:05:57.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.45,0:05:59.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard that he still survived.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.16,0:06:01.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.59,0:06:04.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.19,0:06:06.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid Ice-for-brains.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.00,0:06:08.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really had me worried\Nfor a while there.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.33,0:06:10.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought he was dead for sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.47,0:06:13.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For the record, CP9 might\Nthink that they killed him.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.35,0:06:17.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd keep quiet about it if I were you.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.78,0:06:23.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You act tough but you got a\Nheart in there like anyone else.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.08,0:06:31.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're in trouble now.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.31,0:06:33.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The government's got\Nexactly what they want.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.32,0:06:38.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The only woman with the know-how\Nto bring back an ancient weapon
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.72,0:06:41.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the man with the only\Nknown blueprints for one.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.72,0:06:44.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't that beat all.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.96,0:06:47.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If the government\Nactually gets that power,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.03,0:06:49.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,everything's gonna\Nget turned upside down.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.90,0:06:51.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First they'll end the pirate era.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.80,0:06:56.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to fight back anymore and\Nafter they're done with us just you wait.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.65,0:06:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll turn their guns\Non the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.09,0:07:03.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, those ancient weapons\Nare gonna lead all of mankind to ruin.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.51,0:07:08.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My master didn't lay down his life\Nprotecting those blueprints for nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.04,0:07:13.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not if I have anything\Nto say about it at least!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.85,0:07:17.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But still, there's no point in\Nme making it out of here alone.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.28,0:07:21.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta find some way to get\Nback to Straw Hat, all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.92,0:07:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.66,0:07:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I'm with them, it will\Nonly bring them suffering.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.39,0:07:33.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not the one that's hurting them.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:33.01,0:07:36.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those government bastards may tell\Nyou that your existence is a crime,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.58,0:07:39.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but no matter how dangerous you may be,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.25,0:07:44.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just being alive, just being\Nwho you are is never wrong.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.75,0:07:47.19,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Remember, when a ship is built,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.19,0:07:53.59,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,no matter what type it's\Nneither good nor evil, Franky.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.59,0:07:56.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.30,0:07:59.67,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Her very existence has\Nbeen nothing but a sin.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.67,0:08:05.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What you do is your choice but there's\Nno right or wrong in who you are.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.39,0:08:16.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My goodness, just look at you!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.69,0:08:19.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're covered in scars!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.86,0:08:23.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poor kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.53,0:08:25.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been eight years now.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.27,0:08:29.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eight long years since\NTom was taken away from us.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.64,0:08:33.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've watched you challenge the\Nsea train every day since then.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.01,0:08:35.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Again and again.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.96,0:08:49.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You were trying to get\Nstronger, weren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.38,0:08:55.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you won't have to lose\Nthe ones you love ever again.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.26,0:08:58.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you'll have the\Npower to protect them.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.93,0:09:00.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.83,0:09:02.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.33,0:09:07.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now's the time for you to put that\Ntraining to the test, big boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.80,0:09:09.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.77,0:09:12.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You remember your\Nold pal Franky, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.75,0:09:14.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He got taken away by the bad guys, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.82,0:09:16.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like Tom.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.75,0:09:21.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The good news is, we're on our\Nway to save him as we speak.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.69,0:09:25.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you up for a fight, or what?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.26,0:09:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero Gerooo!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.80,0:09:30.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.34,0:09:32.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I found another friend for ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.84,0:09:35.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.45,0:09:38.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice job, Monster Granny!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.42,0:09:40.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait or is it Frog Granny?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.74,0:09:42.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta tell me these things!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.52,0:09:44.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.47,0:09:47.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You call me whatever you like.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.32,0:09:51.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokoro, I found us a good current\Nfor running to the southwest.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.73,0:09:53.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right then!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.53,0:09:59.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well we wasted a little time back\Nthere but we'll get it back in a flash!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.13,0:10:00.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You heard her, Frog!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.70,0:10:01.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.87,0:10:04.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.70,0:10:09.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,CP9 has arrived!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.34,0:10:11.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look sharp!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.31,0:10:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on\Ncompleting your mission!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.81,0:10:14.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring out the criminals!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.96,0:10:16.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're in car 1!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.40,0:10:20.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, how 'bout you handle me
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.84,0:10:23.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with a little more care, ya lugheads!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:23.15,0:10:26.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where I come from, I'm a VIP.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.05,0:10:27.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, everyone stand back!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.79,0:10:28.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.46,0:10:30.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That guy bites!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.66,0:10:32.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You punks want some of this, huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.50,0:10:33.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Must he be so noisy?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.83,0:10:36.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coo coo!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.87,0:10:43.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen them up close.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.16,0:10:45.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty intimidating.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.23,0:10:48.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That guy's Cutty Flam, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.40,0:10:51.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way, then the woman must be.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.47,0:10:52.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.90,0:10:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, she's gorgeous!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.10,0:10:57.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open the main gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.78,0:11:16.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.72,0:11:17.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.52,0:11:20.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this crazy place?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.35,0:11:31.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A waterfall?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.22,0:11:32.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.33,0:11:43.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't see the bottom!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.40,0:11:45.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure are a noisy one.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.54,0:11:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like Lucci and the\Nothers are headed this way.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.92,0:12:04.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And they've brought me the best\Nsouvenir I could ever possibly wish for.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.82,0:12:07.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At last.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.89,0:12:11.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After five long years,\Nthe time has finally come
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.39,0:12:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for all eight members\Nof CP9, to be reunited.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.10,0:12:17.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This should be a time of celebration.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.87,0:12:21.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But instead I'll ask,\N"What's the meaning of this?"
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.19,0:12:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your orders were to assassinate\Nthe leaders of the revolution!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.69,0:12:27.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But according to this article,\Nnot only did you
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.88,0:12:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kill those three, but\Ntwenty others, as well!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.58,0:12:31.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.55,0:12:33.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you have an excuse,\NI'd like to hear it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.72,0:12:35.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yoyoi!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.39,0:12:39.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}My most sincere apologies\Nand pardons, Chief!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.53,0:12:46.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Everything is entirely,\Nunreservedly, completely, my fault!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.37,0:12:47.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stop that, Kumadori!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.80,0:12:50.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}A real man doesn't bow\Nhis head to anybody!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.87,0:12:53.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll explain everything\Nthat happened to the Chief,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.34,0:12:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}so shut up and get a hold of yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.37,0:12:56.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yoyoi!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.47,0:12:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I can't apologize enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.41,0:13:04.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And so if need be I'll shoulder\Nthe blame by taking my own life!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.22,0:13:05.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be so melodramatic!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.55,0:13:06.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoyoi!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.27,0:13:07.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It happened like this, Chief.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.57,0:13:09.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We followed the plan to the letter.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.19,0:13:11.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We infiltrated their forces and were\Nall ready for the assassination.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.95,0:13:15.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But somehow the enemy managed\Nto find out about our plans!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.49,0:13:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Probably 'cause I was talking\Nabout them all over town, Chapapa!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.82,0:13:20.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You again?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.82,0:13:21.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.91,0:13:23.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what's the point in\Nhaving a zipper on your mouth
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.67,0:13:25.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if it you don't even\Nuse the damn thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.61,0:13:28.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This little blabbermouth problem\Nof yours has got to stop, understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.81,0:13:29.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're secret agents!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.68,0:13:30.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got secrets to keep!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.72,0:13:33.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't do it on purpose, Chapapa!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.22,0:13:34.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you "Chapapa" me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.52,0:13:36.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't do anything\Nabout it now, Chapapa!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.69,0:13:40.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need to blame Fukurou!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.51,0:13:44.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will take full responsibility!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.31,0:13:48.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seppuku! Iron Body!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.61,0:13:51.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't even die right!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.35,0:13:53.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh just get it over with, you bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.35,0:13:55.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd be doing everyone a favor!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.32,0:13:56.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I accidentally talked\Nabout it, Chapapa!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.45,0:13:57.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.72,0:13:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.42,0:14:00.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.59,0:14:01.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hot, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.29,0:14:04.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I spilt my coffee again, dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.07,0:14:07.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, I heard\NNero didn't work out.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.91,0:14:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.44,0:14:18.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't you bulls go any faster?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.56,0:14:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So big bro Franky sacrificed\Nhimself to save you guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.50,0:14:29.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now he's...?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.53,0:14:30.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.43,0:14:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.40,0:14:36.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was trying to rescue Robin\Nand help us escape with her.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.33,0:14:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our Big Bro is such a kind-hearted guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.01,0:14:47.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry or\Nwe won't make it in time.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.75,0:14:50.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.65,0:14:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The lights of the "Nightless Island"!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.42,0:14:54.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Enies Lobby!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.32,0:14:56.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.22,0:14:57.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we made it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.42,0:14:58.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.72,0:15:01.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now we can rescue bro!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.58,0:15:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Nightless Island"?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.05,0:15:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.88,0:15:05.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sun never stops shining there.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.68,0:15:06.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it's "nightless".
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.95,0:15:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They sometimes call the Judicial\NIsland a "Daytime Island", too.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.24,0:15:14.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We found them!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.11,0:15:16.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The giant yagaras!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.21,0:15:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahoy!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.48,0:15:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Luffy!\N– Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.08,0:15:26.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.52,0:15:30.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And...Who the heck it that?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.96,0:15:35.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.20,0:15:38.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like we caught up with 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.60,0:15:39.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.36,0:15:41.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, now that we've found the others.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.73,0:15:44.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time for our date\Nwith the World Government!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.00,0:15:46.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah, it is!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.34,0:15:52.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! This is it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.54,0:15:54.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now approaching Enies Lobby!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.74,0:15:55.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All hands!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.64,0:15:57.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get ready for a showdown!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.52,0:16:10.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Sniper King from Sniper Island?\N– Sniper King from Sniper Island?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.79,0:16:12.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.06,0:16:13.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.13,0:16:14.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a close friend of Usopp's.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.93,0:16:18.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm here because he asked me to aid\Nyou on this perilous journey!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.64,0:16:20.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a super hero!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.68,0:16:21.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.69,0:16:23.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could totally tell\N'cause of the mask and cape!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.89,0:16:24.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.56,0:16:26.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one before!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.30,0:16:29.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So wearing a mask and cape\Nmeans he has super powers?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.41,0:16:30.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Course!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.55,0:16:32.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everybody in a mask\Nand cape is a super hero!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.58,0:16:33.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.25,0:16:33.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Well, yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.95,0:16:35.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Isn't that Usopp?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.19,0:16:37.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're safe, Usopp.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.69,0:16:41.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the long-nose guy that\Nbusted into the Franky House.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.20,0:16:44.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the guy that got\Ntaken away with bro.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.20,0:16:45.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Totally.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.00,0:16:46.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No question.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.04,0:16:48.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's... It's nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.00,0:16:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.10,0:16:50.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's one of the guys\Nwe met at the Shift Station.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.97,0:16:51.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meow!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.73,0:16:52.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I have your autograph?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.87,0:16:54.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.84,0:16:59.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that makes me\Nwonder...Where did Usopp go?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.75,0:17:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.68,0:17:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry about him.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.85,0:17:07.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Anyway, he told me the most important thing\Nright now is saving your friend Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.71,0:17:08.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then he left.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.71,0:17:09.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.49,0:17:10.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's absolutely right.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.99,0:17:15.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, uh...So where exactly\Nis this Sniper Island?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.83,0:17:17.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.26,0:17:26.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's inside of your heart.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.09,0:17:26.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wow!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.37,0:17:34.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously. Where?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.17,0:17:41.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sing it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.31,0:17:45.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey, Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.56,0:17:46.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.79,0:17:49.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yeah? What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.33,0:17:50.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just a second.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.33,0:17:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rest of you idiots\Nshould hear this, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.76,0:17:54.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before we go to rescue Robin...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.26,0:17:56.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something you
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.56,0:18:05.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So there you have it.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.03,0:18:10.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those CP9 guys are controlling Robin by\Nusing her childhood fears against her.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.57,0:18:13.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not making excuses for\Nnot being able to save her.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.97,0:18:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to make it clear\Nthat even if we march in
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.14,0:18:18.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to get her back, it doesn't\Nnecessarily mean
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.24,0:18:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that she'll be willing\Nto return with us.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.71,0:18:23.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None of that matters!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.68,0:18:26.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't stand for this!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.05,0:18:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.39,0:18:31.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not her fault!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.03,0:18:32.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course it is, Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.33,0:18:34.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't she want us to rescue her?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.23,0:18:35.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.30,0:18:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because she doesn't\Nwanna feel responsible
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.57,0:18:39.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for all the awful things that'll\Nhappen to our crew once we do!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.74,0:18:41.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care about all that!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.19,0:18:44.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we don't rescue her, she's\Ngonna be killed, isn't she?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.02,0:18:46.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way she wants to die,\Nso we're gonna save her!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.75,0:18:49.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well of course she doesn't\Nwant to die, but still!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.06,0:18:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let it go.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.00,0:18:53.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This doesn't change what we have to do.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.67,0:18:55.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll save her either way.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.17,0:18:58.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat up\Nevery last one of them!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.31,0:19:01.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a new move I wanna try!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.80,0:19:07.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, take a look at this.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.97,0:19:12.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I came to this island once before\Nto do some maintenance on the railway.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.79,0:19:14.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I drew this from what I could remember.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.22,0:19:19.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a rough sketch of the\Noverall layout of Enies Lobby.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.81,0:19:26.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Gates of Justice are located\Nat the back of the island.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.81,0:19:29.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The only way to get to them\Nis through the Tower of Law.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.32,0:19:31.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that big black thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.92,0:19:33.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It represents the waterfall.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.72,0:19:34.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.66,0:19:35.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.36,0:19:37.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once we're inside, you'll see.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.59,0:19:39.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we don't rescue\NFranky and Nico Robin
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.69,0:19:41.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}before they pass through the Main Gate
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.16,0:19:43.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and into the Gates of\NJustice, then that's it.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.78,0:19:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.91,0:19:46.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And why's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.25,0:19:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter\Nwhere they take her to,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.51,0:19:50.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we'll just keep on fighting\Nthem until we get Robin back!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.42,0:19:53.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I explained this before\Nwe left Water 7, remember?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.32,0:19:55.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once we pass that gate,\Nthe only two places
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.76,0:19:58.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we can go are Navy Headquarters\Nor the deep-sea prison.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.29,0:20:02.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, we have to settle\Nthis before they reach those rear gates.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.55,0:20:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep. Pretty much.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.45,0:20:08.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On top of that, even if we all\Nrushed the island at the same time,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.19,0:20:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the only ones capable of going\Nup against those CP9 guys...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.19,0:20:13.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– are you Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.96,0:20:16.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After seeing what you can do,\NI know how strong you are.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.93,0:20:20.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why I think you should\Nstay behind once we get there.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.53,0:20:24.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give us five minutes, then charge\Nthrough to the main island in Rocketman.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.41,0:20:27.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Franky Family and Galley-La will go\Nin first and break open the Main Gate
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.84,0:20:31.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the Main Island Front Gate\Nso the train can pass through.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.12,0:20:32.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll suffer\Na lot of casualties,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.95,0:20:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but remember: Once you're in,\Nkeep going no matter what.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.45,0:20:37.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't look back.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.46,0:20:40.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've only got a little over 60 people.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.40,0:20:44.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The enemy forces probably have\Nsomewhere between 2 and 3 thousand.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.44,0:20:46.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our best chance for victory\Nis for you Straw Hats
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.57,0:20:50.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to concentrate on CP9 and leave\Nthe rest of the marines to us.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.91,0:20:52.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, I got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.18,0:20:54.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, folks!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.15,0:20:57.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're pulling up to\Nthe front of the island!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.55,0:21:01.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While we're here, take a look\Nat the sky behind Enies Lobby.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.83,0:21:02.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.73,0:21:04.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Gates of Justice.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.93,0:21:06.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.97,0:21:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's huge!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.55,0:21:16.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not a good idea\Nto open them all the way.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.71,0:21:18.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When it comes time to\Nsend a criminal through,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.82,0:21:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they only unlatch them\Njust enough to let 'em pass.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.05,0:21:24.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Behind that gate are\Nsome big sea kings.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.62,0:21:27.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That part of the sea is\Na lot like the Calm Belt:
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.25,0:21:30.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An eerie body of water cutting\Nright through the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.60,0:21:32.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No normal ship would\Ndare to sail there.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.83,0:21:35.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'd be lost forever.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.00,0:21:37.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know how they managed to do it,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.43,0:21:40.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but somehow the Navy figured out\Na way to make it through safely.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.65,0:21:45.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words, it's like the pirate girl\Nsaid: You can't take back a criminal once
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.28,0:21:46.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they pass through those gates.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.55,0:21:50.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any chance of a rescue is gonna\Nhave to happen before they open.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.49,0:21:51.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.42,0:21:52.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hop to it!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.22,0:21:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no time to lose!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.76,0:21:58.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll head in first and clear a path\Nfor you, just like we planned!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.50,0:22:01.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give 'em hell, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.00,0:22:02.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.26,0:22:03.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.21,0:22:04.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't you supposed to be with us?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.98,0:22:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.17,0:22:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.21,0:22:12.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.91,0:22:14.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was here just a second ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.47,0:22:21.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.17,0:22:23.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.01,0:22:29.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– What?\N– What?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.31,0:22:31.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is he going in on his own?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.70,0:22:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That crazy Straw Hat didn't\Nunderstand the plan at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.34,0:22:39.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There goes our strategy.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.01,0:22:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said "Right! I got it", didn't he?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.14,0:22:44.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's really not the\Nwait-five-minutes type.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.06,0:22:45.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn. Should have known.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.04,0:22:49.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's an impatient one, isn't he?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.44,0:22:50.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.74,0:22:52.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, Mister Pirate!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.22,0:22:53.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meow!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.35,0:22:55.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero, gero!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.82,0:22:56.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too late now!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.52,0:22:57.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's move!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.22,0:22:59.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sodom! Gomorrah!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.46,0:23:03.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jump over that iron fence and\Nthen break open the main gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.35,0:23:13.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum Gum...Rocket!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.02,0:23:18.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.50,0:23:20.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something just flew over!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.06,0:23:24.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.36,0:23:25.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's up with this place?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.83,0:23:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a huge hole!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.40,0:23:30.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like the island's\Nfloating or something!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.50,0:23:32.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's someone up on the flagpole!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.00,0:23:35.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot him down before he gets away!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.42,0:23:36.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoops!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.12,0:23:38.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess they spotted me!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.53,0:23:42.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He went inside the main gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.76,0:23:44.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:46.70,0:23:49.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the Main Gate!\NThis is the Main Gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.74,0:23:53.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have an urgent message for the Chief\NOfficer at the Main Island Front Gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.28,0:23:54.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the Main Gate!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.45,0:23:56.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.98,0:23:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Spandam.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:58.42,0:23:59.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.65,0:24:01.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An intruder somehow managed\Nto pass through the Main Gate
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.84,0:24:04.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and is heading toward\Nthe Main Island, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.13,0:24:04.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One intruder?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.95,0:24:06.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what all this fuss is about?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.86,0:24:08.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surely you can manage\Nto take care of him.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.72,0:24:09.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.39,0:24:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't understand, it's... This\Nis the Main Island Front Gate.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.47,0:24:13.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Intruder sighting confirmed.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.87,0:24:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.77,0:24:16.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll take care of things from here.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.25,0:24:20.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey there, buddy!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.28,0:24:21.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's far enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.31,0:24:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you have the slightest\Nidea where you are?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.96,0:24:25.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't take this guy lightly!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.66,0:24:28.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unless my eyes deceive me,\Nthen I'm pretty sure that he's...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.86,0:24:31.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pirate Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.01,0:24:34.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.17,0:24:39.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that you just said?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.87,0:24:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The man with the\N100 million berry bounty!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.77,0:24:44.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is him!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.07,0:24:45.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.98,0:24:52.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Robin?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.29,0:25:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me where Robin is right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.59,0:01:55.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dumb frog!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:58.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.31,0:02:05.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't "gero" me, you big slimy jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.56,0:02:09.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You realize that that slap of yours derailed\Nour train, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.53,0:02:10.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Froggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:08.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
